    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "B*Ai §/ JAPAN AIR LINES\n747280O MET INSTAUCTIONS\n*TAKE-OFF AND LANDING\nSEAT POSITION\nDO NOT REMOVE FROM AIRCRAFT\nSet seat back\nand table in\nupright position.\nNO SMOKING\nRefrain from smoking in\nrestrooms or aisles.\n#Lit To fasten\nFASTEN SEAT\nBELT\nTo tighten\nKeep seat belt fastened\nwhenever seated.\nTo unfasten\nA*ER 7ZZOXYGEN MASK\nOxygen mask will appear automatically when needed\nPut out your\ncigarette immediately.",
      "EMERGENCY EXITS\n#**** FOR EVACUATION\nDo not carry any baggage.\nATE-HELTEL\nRemove highheeled shoes.\n6000000000000000\n300'\nD0000000000000\nPut out cigarettes before\nevacuating.\n000000\nAfter evacuating, move away\nfrom the aircraft.\n#*0*5*** USE OF EMERGENCY EXITS\nDO NOT REMOVE FROM AIRCRAFT",
      "747 D\nB*Ai §/ JAPAN AIR LINES\nTEALS SAFETY INSTRUCTIONS\nInflate when instructed by a crew member.\n2\n3\n4\n5\n#đt3.\nTo inflate\nPull string to\nlight emer\ngency\nbeacon.\nFor extra\ninflation, blow\ninto mouth\npieces.\n*I** BRACE POSITIONS"
    ],
